'''Wrath of the Divine''' is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]] and appears every Saturday. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Clockwork Cat (Rare Cat)|Clockwork Cat]]: Puppetmaster & Charley.

